# Strict typing

Follow `docs/typing-policy.md` (basedpyright strict + Ruff on Python; ESLint/tsc on TS).

## Python

- Prefer concrete types, `TypedDict`, and `Mapping[str, object]` over loose dicts.
- Run Ruff and basedpyright from repo root after `uv sync`.

```bash
uv run ruff check .
uv run ruff format --check .
uv run basedpyright
```

## TypeScript

When PR touches `apps/frontend/` or legacy `frontend/`:

```bash
pnpm exec eslint .
pnpm exec tsc --noEmit
```

See also `ci-after-push.mdc` for full CI parity.
